    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.poster.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.webm?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.mp4?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >House Fighters: Total Mess is a playful arcade dogfighting game. Hop into a toy plane, zip through cozy rooms, and turn everyday objects into thrilling battlegrounds. No complicated controls, just pure, lighthearted aerial chaos. Weave between bookshelves, dodge towering lamps, and outmaneuver tiny enemies in fast-paced, feel-good combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/e93c2bb74130f6d15c7281c189adfb52.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.poster.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.webm?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.mp4?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, weave, and strike in high-speed dogfights. Use rockets, bombs, and even household items to outmaneuver your toy-sized foes. Complete rescue missions to save your friends from threats in the toy room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/df7b1327d9b67d10a7ca6fed15fdc491.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.poster.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.webm?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.mp4?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fighter with playful stickers, wacky weapons, and unexpected upgrades. Experiment and find the perfect loadout for every mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/9fd1a4ca95e3ff0e9b797572f47acdfe.avif?t=1754994890\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.poster.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.webm?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.mp4?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase, dodge, and loop through playful missions where every room holds a new challenge. Sneak past towering obstacles, weave through tight spaces, and take on clever little foes in fast, lighthearted dogfights.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.poster.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.webm?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.mp4?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >House Fighters: Total Mess is a playful arcade dogfighting game. Hop into a toy plane, zip through cozy rooms, and turn everyday objects into thrilling battlegrounds. No complicated controls, just pure, lighthearted aerial chaos. Weave between bookshelves, dodge towering lamps, and outmaneuver tiny enemies in fast-paced, feel-good combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/e93c2bb74130f6d15c7281c189adfb52.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.poster.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.webm?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.mp4?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, weave, and strike in high-speed dogfights. Use rockets, bombs, and even household items to outmaneuver your toy-sized foes. Complete rescue missions to save your friends from threats in the toy room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/df7b1327d9b67d10a7ca6fed15fdc491.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.poster.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.webm?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.mp4?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fighter with playful stickers, wacky weapons, and unexpected upgrades. Experiment and find the perfect loadout for every mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/9fd1a4ca95e3ff0e9b797572f47acdfe.avif?t=1754994890\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.poster.avif?t=1754994890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.webm?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.mp4?t=1754994890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase, dodge, and loop through playful missions where every room holds a new challenge. Sneak past towering obstacles, weave through tight spaces, and take on clever little foes in fast, lighthearted dogfights.</p>",
    "short_description": "House Fighters: Total Mess is a PvE aerial arcade shooter where toy planes battle in everyday spaces. Engage in fast-paced dogfights in this nostalgia-filled world, take on clever foes, and fight to save your fellow toy friends!",
